{"approach": "The approach discussed in the article involves the use of Gaussian Mixture Models (GMMs) in continual learning, particularly in techniques like Gaussian Mixture Replay (GMR), PromptCCD, and Adiabatic Replay (AR). This method aims to enhance the performance and adaptability of learning models by integrating prompts and GMMs within the Gauss-Tin method for the Continual Learning (CL) framework. The approach is characterized by its probabilistic nature, effective modeling of data distributions, and facilitation of representation learning."},
