{"superior_results_in_both_forward_and_backward_transfer_scenarios": "Superior results in both forward and backward transfer scenarios refer to the enhanced performance achieved by the Gauss-Tin method. This includes higher average performance scores in tasks involving the transfer of knowledge from one context to another, demonstrating the method's effectiveness in retaining and applying knowledge across different scenarios."},
