{"explorations__prove__efficacy_not_only_in_knowledge_retention_but_also_in_enhancing_generalization_to_new_unseen_domains": "Proving in this context means demonstrating through empirical evidence and experimental results the effectiveness and benefits of the Gauss-Tin method. It involves showing how the method performs in various scenarios and its impact on knowledge retention and generalization."},
