{"efforts": "The efforts refer to future research initiatives and additional studies aimed at exploring the integration of prompts and GMM within the CL framework. These efforts are focused on understanding how different configurations and types of prompts and GMM can influence learning outcomes across various tasks and datasets.|Here is another description: The efforts refer to the ongoing research and development activities aimed at enhancing the Gauss-Tin method within the continual learning (CL) framework. These efforts involve integrating prompts and Gaussian Mixture Models (GMM) to improve the method's performance in both forward and backward transfer scenarios."},
