{"deeper_insights_into_the_dynamics_between_specialization_and_generalization_within_the_cl_environment": "Deeper insights into the dynamics between specialization and generalization within the CL environment refer to a more comprehensive understanding of how the CL framework can balance task-specific learning with the ability to generalize across different domains. This includes exploring how the integration of prompts and GMM can enhance both knowledge retention and adaptability in dynamically changing environments."},
{"efforts__could_lead_to__development_of_more_robust_models_for_dynamically_changing_environments": "The phrase \"could lead to\" indicates a potential outcome or result that may arise from the described efforts. In this context, it suggests that the research and development activities focused on integrating prompts and GMM within the Gauss-Tin method have the potential to result in significant advancements."},
