{"continual_learning": "Continual Learning is an area of study within the broader field of Machine Learning that focuses on developing algorithms and models capable of learning sequentially from new data without forgetting previously acquired knowledge.|Here is another description: Continual Learning is a subfield of machine learning that focuses on training models to learn multiple tasks sequentially without forgetting previously learned information. It aims to mimic the human ability to learn continuously over time."},
