{"a_task_specific_prompt__can_select__samples_that_best_align_with_the_desired_task_characteristics": "The ability to select implies that the task-specific prompt has the capability to assess and choose from a set of options based on predefined criteria or characteristics pertinent to the task at hand."},
{"samples_that_best_align_with_the_desired_task_characteristics": "Samples that best align with the desired task characteristics refer to the optimal selections made by the task-specific prompt, which are deemed most suitable or effective for achieving the intended outcomes of the task."},
{"this_section__describes__the_experimental_setup_baseline_comparisons_and_details_of_our_approach_s_implementation": "The verb \"describes\" indicates that the section provides a detailed account or explanation of certain elements related to the experiment."},
