{"a_wide_range_of_natural_language_processing_nlp_tasks": "The object describes a wide range of natural language processing (NLP) tasks included in the dataset. These tasks are diverse and include question generation, answer generation, classification, incorrect answer generation, minimal modification, and verification tasks, each with specific natural language instructions to guide the model."},
