{"detailed_natural_language_instructions": "Detailed natural language instructions are comprehensive guidelines given for each task in the dataset. These instructions are designed to help models understand and perform the specific task by providing clear, step-by-step explanations in natural language, ensuring that the model can effectively process and generate the required outputs.|Here is another description: Detailed natural language instructions are comprehensive guidelines provided in a human-readable format to explain specific tasks or processes. In the context of the Natural Instructions Version 1 dataset, these instructions are designed to be clear and thorough to facilitate understanding and execution by a model."},
{"detailed_natural_language_instructions__guide__the_model_in_performing_the_task": "The predicate \"guide\" in this context refers to the action of providing direction or instructions to help the model understand and perform a specific task. It implies a relationship where the instructions serve as a navigational aid for the model, ensuring it can correctly interpret and execute the task at hand."},
{"the_model_in_performing_the_task": "The model in this context is an artificial intelligence system designed to perform various natural language processing tasks. It relies on the provided detailed natural language instructions to understand the requirements of each task and to generate appropriate outputs, whether it be question generation, answer generation, classification, or other specified tasks."},
