{"split": "The split refers to the process of dividing the dataset into two subsets: a training set and unseen tasks. This division is crucial for the implementation process as it sets the stage for subsequent steps such as clustering and model evaluation.|Here is another description: The split refers to the division of the dataset into two subsets: a training set and unseen tasks. This division is crucial for organizing the data in a way that supports both learning and evaluation processes."},
