{"integration_of_prompts_and_gmm": "The integration of prompts and GMM refers to the combination of task-directed prompts and Gaussian Mixture Models (GMM) within the Gauss-Tin method for the Continual Learning (CL) framework. This integration aims to enhance the adaptability and robustness of the learning model by leveraging the strengths of both components."},
