{"efforts__provide__deeper_insights_into_the_dynamics_between_specialization_and_generalization_within_the_cl_environment": "The predicate \"provide\" indicates that these research efforts are intended to yield or supply valuable outcomes, specifically deeper insights, by exploring and analyzing the combined effects of prompts and GMM in the CL environment."},
{"deeper_insights_into_the_dynamics_between_specialization_and_generalization_within_the_cl_environment": "Deeper insights into the dynamics between specialization and generalization within the CL environment refer to a more profound understanding of how the integration of prompts and GMM influences the balance between task-specific performance (specialization) and the ability to generalize knowledge across different tasks and domains within the CL framework."},
