{"methods_with_and_without_prompt_and_gaussian_mixture_models_gmm_for_sample_generation": "Methods With and Without Prompt and Gaussian Mixture Models (GMM) for Sample Generation refers to a set of techniques and approaches used to generate samples. These methods include those that utilize prompts and Gaussian Mixture Models (GMM) as well as those that do not, allowing for a comprehensive comparison."},
